  "worked_solution": "For the given matrix $A,$ we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}2-3\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ 1+\\text{i} & 5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2-3\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ 1+\\text{i} & 0+5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]}_{\u23df}}_{\\text{Re}(A)}+\\text{i}{{[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{aligned}]}_{\u23df}}_{\\text{Im}(A)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $c=1,d=0,g=1$ and $h=5.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\ncd+gh=1\\cdot 0+1\\cdot 5=5.\n$$",
